If users hit this error, overwrite and upsert are both enabled, which isn't supported. They should pick one:

**Overwrite / reload** — keep `.overwrite(true)`, do not set `upsertMode` / equality fields (data files only).

**CDC / upsert** — keep upsert, set `.overwrite(false)` (or omit it; default is false) so delete files go through the row-delta path.

